{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1975"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge society/politics","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/society__politics.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",338],["+","as the 6th Federal President "],["=",680],["-","Berlin,"],["+","Berlin;"],["=",1],["-","and"],["+","the"],["=",1],["-","since"],["+","Villa"],["=",1],["+","Hammerschmidt in Bonn, "],["=",2],["-","move"],["+","main"],["=",1],["-","from"],["+","seat"],["=",1],["-","Bonn"],["+","until"],["=",1],["+","1994, remains "],["=",2],["+","second official residence. At both, the presidential "],["=",10],["-","flies"],["+","serves"],["=",1],["-","there"],["+","as"],["=",1],["-","whenever"],["+","a"],["=",1],["+","signal of presence: on "],["=",2],["-","president"],["+","roof"],["=",1],["+","of the Villa Hammerschmidt it "],["=",2],["+","hoisted only when the Federal President is "],["=",2],["+","residence there.\n\nOne thing "],["=",2],["-","country."],["+","list has never shown is a woman. For the period from 1949 to 2010 the count of female Federal Presidents is 0 (none), and none has been elected since, although women such as Hildegard Hamm-Brücher (1994), Dagmar Schipanski (1999) and Gesine Schwan (2004 and 2009) stood as candidates in the Federal Convention."]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",310],["+","als 6. Bundespräsident "],["=",620],["+","Erster "],["=",10],["-","Berlin,"],["+","Berlin;"],["=",1],["-","und"],["+","die"],["=",1],["-","seit"],["+","Villa"],["=",1],["-","dem"],["+","Hammerschmidt"],["=",1],["-","Umzug"],["+","in"],["=",1],["-","aus"],["+","Bonn,"],["=",1],["-","Bonn"],["+","bis"],["=",1],["-","weht"],["+","1994"],["=",1],["-","dort"],["+","der"],["=",1],["+","Hauptsitz, ist zweiter Amtssitz geblieben. An beiden dient "],["=",4],["+","des Bundespräsidenten "],["=",4],["-","Bundesadler,"],["+","Bundesadler"],["=",1],["-","wann"],["+","als"],["=",1],["-","immer"],["+","Zeichen"],["=",3],["-","Präsident"],["+","Anwesenheit:"],["=",1],["-","im"],["+","Auf"],["=",1],["-","Land"],["+","dem"],["=",1],["+","Dach der Villa Hammerschmidt wird sie nur gehisst, wenn der Bundespräsident dort anwesend "],["=",1],["+","\n\nEines hat die Liste noch nie gezeigt: eine Frau. Für die Zeit von 1949 bis 2010 lautet die Zahl der Bundespräsidentinnen 0 (keine), und auch seither wurde keine gewählt, obwohl Frauen wie Hildegard Hamm-Brücher (1994), Dagmar Schipanski (1999) und Gesine Schwan (2004 und 2009) in der Bundesversammlung kandidierten."]]}]},
